---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Plan your visit — MPCBC" description="What to expect when you visit Monterey Park Chinese Baptist Church: parking, children, and what the first fifteen minutes look like.">
  <div class="wrap wrap--narrow section">
    <h1>Plan your visit</h1>
    <p class="lede">Everything you might wonder about before Sunday morning.</p>

    <h2>Where to park</h2>
    <p>There is a lot behind the building off the side street, and street parking is
    usually easy on Sunday mornings. Come in through the covered porch on the right.</p>

    <h2>What to wear</h2>
    <p>Whatever you are comfortable in. You will see suits and you will see jeans.</p>

    <h2>Bringing children</h2>
    <p>Children are welcome in every service. Sunday school runs during the 11:00
    service, and there is a staffed nursery for the youngest.</p>

    <h2>Which service should I go to?</h2>
    <p>Whichever language you are most at home in. Many families split up for the
    service and find each other afterwards over lunch.</p>

    <h2>The first fifteen minutes</h2>
    <p>Someone will greet you at the door and hand you a bulletin. Find a seat
    anywhere. We sing for about twenty minutes, then the sermon runs half an hour.
    Nobody will ask you to stand up or introduce yourself.</p>
  </div>
</Base>
<style>
  .lede { font-size: var(--step-1); color: var(--ink-soft); }
  h2 { font-size: var(--step-1); margin-top: 2rem; }
</style>
